{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noor\u00a0</strong>is a\u00a0stylized top-down action-adventure game inspired by ancient Arabic mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/5213cc24733d8dc32fca6f17365199db.poster.avif?t=1754988811\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/5213cc24733d8dc32fca6f17365199db.webm?t=1754988811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/5213cc24733d8dc32fca6f17365199db.mp4?t=1754988811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/ae82d690cfb3eda7f10fe41191c5a03b.avif?t=1754988811\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as &quot;Siraj&quot; (the adorable Floppa) and fight the darkness to restore your world's lost memories! Gather these memories using your lantern,\u00a0and unlock its full power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/4dd5b14610d15cf3d71b5f3694a33e82.avif?t=1754988811\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel and embark on a legendary adventure through magical forests, towering mountains, serene lakes, and scorching deserts! Each new world brings its own challenges, enemies, and exciting new abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/bdb35863d792a10b45e2754b313045c3.avif?t=1754988811\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to face mighty foes and epic bosses lurking in the shadows. Every battle you face will test your skill, reflexes, and courage!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/0a5349c77304e69ce3e50f3451dc5442.avif?t=1754988811\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as you like:</strong>\u00a0Full support for PC, Steam Deck, Xbox Controller, PS\u00a0Controllers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Easy to Learn, Hard to Master:</strong>\u00a0Simple controls with thrilling, challenging battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration:</strong>\u00a0Venture into an engaging world that rewards your curiosity at every turn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/934834e351d9ba76cdd944580ae9dbcd.poster.avif?t=1754988811\" width=616 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/934834e351d9ba76cdd944580ae9dbcd.webm?t=1754988811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/934834e351d9ba76cdd944580ae9dbcd.mp4?t=1754988811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/extras/296161dbb4b2153db842f0d559afa65f.avif?t=1754988811\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in its early development stage. We have big ambitions to make it one of the most captivating adventure games, and we\u2019re excited to share more details with you very soon! <strong>(<i>Please consider wish-listing the game to help us </i>\ud83d\udc9c)</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For more info, please follow us on social media; we will share dev-logs, weekly updates and answer your questions about the game\u00a0 \u2e1c(\uff61\u02c3 \u1d55 \u02c2 )\u2e1d\u2661</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000\u3000\u3000.\u2002\u2002 \u3000\u3000\u02da\u3000\u272d\u3000 \u3000\u3000*\u3000\u3000 \u3000\u3000\u2726\u3000\u3000\u3000.\u3000\u3000.\u3000\u3000\u3000\u2726\u3000\u02da \u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u2008\u02da\u3000.\u02da\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000\u3000</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3728760?t=1754988811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/a02a5776f2c2fdb19e13441de5b967d457055a6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1754988811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/cad8da84e3fd8c612374002f3dc253c697112a51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1754988811","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3728760/cad8da84e3fd8c612374002f3dc253c697112a51/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1754988811","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Noor\u00a0</strong>is a\u00a0stylized top-down action-adventure game inspired by ancient Arabic mythology. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_